  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Following several rat problems, the Prasinos Castle's royal engineers were tasked with producing constructs to monitor the sewers and break infestations without the risk of introducing new diseases to the populace. And so the series of Sewer Keeper golems were introduced. On set days they are released into the sewers to assist in reducing the rat population. Sometimes, they patrol further than directed and come into contact with various thugs who attempt to destroy them for their territorial intrusion."
